## 数据库持久化

生产环境通常使用数据库存储对话。以下是典型的表结构设计：

```json
{
  "tables": {
    "threads": {
      "columns": {
        "id": "TEXT PRIMARY KEY",
        "title": "TEXT",
        "created_at": "TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()",
        "updated_at": "TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()"
      }
    },
    "messages": {
      "columns": {
        "id": "TEXT PRIMARY KEY",
        "thread_id": "TEXT REFERENCES threads(id)",
        "role": "TEXT NOT NULL",
        "content": "TEXT NOT NULL",
        "created_at": "TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()"
      },
      "indexes": ["thread_id", "created_at"]
    }
  }
}
```

